        "id": 207994,
        "name": "Chaosmancer",
        "username": "Chaosmancer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/{size}/1977_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-07T11:58:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>First, I must be that guy, as all English Majors must be.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It is Sentinels, not Sentials.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Other than that, skimming through this it looks incredibly good. I do believe Omnitron-U no longer has any time powers, that was mostly just the one time, and that may confuse your friends because even minor time powers are pretty ridiculous in a fight.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Also, I am amused how many people have their weakness as some variation of \"arrogant\", they all fit of course, but wow, that is a common flaw in people with super-powers it seems. Kind of makes Legacy and HAka's humbleness stand out more.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Anyways, super cool and I my reference back to it in the future, even if only for that Stargent Seal picture...</p>",
