        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_almighty_weasel/{size}/2130_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-07T14:10:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just wish we knew the rules for the Cosmic Contest. It's hard to speculate without knowing the circumstances in which the conflict happens. It's obviously not Blank White Room rules, or the tech bracket would be worthless. Are competitors compelled to fight their hardest, regardless of their previous relationships with whoever they're fighting?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is a good summary, by the way. :)</p>",
